            <!-- OVERVIEW -->

            <section class="database-section">

                <div class="database-heading">
                    OVERVIEW
                </div>

                <p>
                    The period designated as
                    <strong>BEFORE THE KEYBLADE WAR</strong>
                    encompasses the final known era of the ancient
                    world preceding the conflict that would destroy
                    the original civilization of Keyblade wielders.
                </p>

                <p>
                    During this period, the Master of Masters trained
                    six apprentices, established the five Unions and
                    prepared a select group of Keyblade wielders for
                    the coming catastrophe.
                </p>

                <p>
                    The Master possessed knowledge of future events
                    through the Keyblade known as No Name and used
                    that knowledge to construct a plan surrounding
                    the inevitable Keyblade War.
                </p>

                <p>
                    The period culminated in the disappearance of the
                    Master of Masters, the growing conflict between
                    the Foretellers and the eventual beginning of the
                    Keyblade War.
                </p>

            </section>


            <!-- AGE OF FAIRY TALES -->

            <section class="database-section">

                <div class="database-heading">
                    AGE OF FAIRY TALES
                </div>

                <p>
                    The events recorded in this period occurred during
                    what later generations would remember as an age
                    of fairy tales.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Keyblade wielders existed openly and gathered the
                    light known as Lux while defending the world from
                    Heartless.
                </p>

                <p>
                    The civilization of this period was centered around
                    Daybreak Town and the Keyblade wielders who served
                    under the five Unions.
                </p>

            </section>


            <!-- DAYBREAK TOWN -->

            <section class="database-section">

                <div class="database-heading">
                    DAYBREAK TOWN
                </div>

                <div class="database-list">

                    <a href="../locations/daybreak-town.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        DAYBREAK TOWN

                    </a>

                </div>

                <p>
                    Daybreak Town served as the principal center of
                    Keyblade wielding society during this period.
                </p>

                <p>
                    The Master of Masters operated from the city and
                    used its facilities to communicate with his
                    apprentices and oversee the development of his
                    plan.
                </p>

                <p>
                    The city would eventually become the site of the
                    conflict that initiated the Keyblade War.
                </p>

            </section>


            <!-- MASTER OF MASTERS -->

            <section class="database-section">

                <div class="database-heading">
                    MASTER OF MASTERS
                </div>

                <div class="database-list">

                    <a href="../people/master-of-masters.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        MASTER OF MASTERS

                    </a>

                </div>

                <p>
                    The Master of Masters was the central figure of
                    this period.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Possessing knowledge of events beyond his own
                    time, he prepared his apprentices for a future
                    conflict that he considered inevitable.
                </p>

                <p>
                    His actions established the conditions that would
                    ultimately lead to the Keyblade War.
                </p>

            </section>


            <!-- SIX APPRENTICES -->

            <section class="database-section">

                <div class="database-heading">
                    SIX APPRENTICES
                </div>

                <div class="database-list">


                    <a href="../people/ira.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        IRA

                    </a>


                    <a href="../people/aced.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        ACED

                    </a>


                    <a href="../people/invi.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        INVI

                    </a>


                    <a href="../people/gula.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        GULA

                    </a>


                    <a href="../people/ava.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        AVA

                    </a>


                    <a href="../people/luxu.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        LUXU

                    </a>


                </div>

                <p>
                    The Master of Masters trained six apprentices and
                    gave each a specific role within his long-term
                    plan.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Five became the Foretellers and leaders of the
                    Unions. Luxu was given a separate mission and was
                    excluded from the distribution of the Book of
                    Prophecies.
                </p>

            </section>


            <!-- FORETELLERS -->

            <section class="database-section">

                <div class="database-heading">
                    THE FORETELLERS
                </div>

                <div class="database-list">


                    <a href="../people/ira.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        IRA

                    </a>


                    <a href="../people/invi.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        INVI

                    </a>


                    <a href="../people/aced.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        ACED

                    </a>


                    <a href="../people/gula.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        GULA

                    </a>


                    <a href="../people/ava.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        AVA

                    </a>


                </div>

                <p>
                    Five of the Master's apprentices were appointed
                    as Foretellers and given leadership of the five
                    Unions.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Each Foreteller received a copy of the Book of
                    Prophecies and a specific role intended to guide
                    the events preceding the coming war.
                </p>

            </section>


            <!-- BOOK OF PROPHECIES -->

            <section class="database-section">

                <div class="database-heading">
                    BOOK OF PROPHECIES
                </div>

                <div class="database-list">

                    <a href="../entities/book-of-prophecies.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        BOOK OF PROPHECIES

                    </a>

                </div>

                <p>
                    The Book of Prophecies contained records of
                    future events observed through the Master's
                    Keyblade.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Its final passages foretold a great battle in
                    which darkness would prevail and the light would
                    expire.
                </p>

                <p>
                    The revelation of the prophecy became one of the
                    principal causes of tension between the
                    Foretellers.
                </p>

            </section>


            <!-- NO NAME -->

            <section class="database-section">

                <div class="database-heading">
                    NO NAME
                </div>

                <div class="database-list">

                    <a href="../entities/no-name.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        NO NAME

                    </a>

                </div>

                <p>
                    The Master of Masters used the Keyblade known as
                    No Name to observe events beyond his own time.
                </p>

                <p>
                    The Keyblade contains the Gazing Eye, which
                    allowed the Master to record events witnessed
                    through the weapon.
                </p>

                <p>
                    The weapon was eventually entrusted to Luxu as
                    part of the Master's long-term plan.
                </p>

            </section>


            <!-- THE UNIONS -->

            <section class="database-section">

                <div class="database-heading">
                    THE FIVE UNIONS
                </div>

                <div class="database-list">


                    <a href="../organizations/keyblade-wielders.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        KEYBLADE WIELDERS

                    </a>

                </div>

                <p>
                    The Master of Masters established five Unions,
                    each led by one of the Foretellers.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Their members gathered Lux and fought the
                    Heartless in an attempt to preserve the world's
                    light.
                </p>

                <p>
                    The five Unions would later become the primary
                    factions involved in the conflict that culminated
                    in the Keyblade War.
                </p>

            </section>


            <!-- UNION FORMATION -->

            <section class="database-section">

                <div class="database-heading">
                    UNION FORMATION
                </div>

                <div class="database-list">

                    <a href="union-x-formation.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        THE FORMATION OF THE UNIONS

                    </a>

                </div>

                <p>
                    The formation of the Unions established the
                    organizational structure through which the
                    Keyblade wielders operated.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Although their stated purpose was to protect the
                    light, the separation of the wielders into
                    competing factions would eventually contribute to
                    the coming conflict.
                </p>

            </section>


            <!-- LUXU -->

            <section class="database-section">

                <div class="database-heading">
                    LUXU
                </div>

                <div class="database-list">

                    <a href="../people/luxu.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        LUXU

                    </a>

                </div>

                <p>
                    Luxu was the sixth apprentice of the Master of
                    Masters and received a mission fundamentally
                    different from those assigned to the Foretellers.
                </p>

                <p>
                    He was instructed to observe the events that
                    would follow and preserve the Master's plan across
                    generations.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Luxu was entrusted with No Name and the Black Box,
                    neither of which was to be abandoned during the
                    coming destruction.
                </p>

            </section>


            <!-- LOST PAGE -->

            <section class="database-section">

                <div class="database-heading">
                    THE LOST PAGE
                </div>

                <div class="database-list">

                    <a href="../entities/book-of-prophecies.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        BOOK OF PROPHECIES

                    </a>

                </div>

                <p>
                    A hidden portion of the Book of Prophecies
                    contained information that was not revealed to
                    the Foretellers.
                </p>

                <p>
                    The Lost Page became central to the growing
                    suspicion that one of the Foretellers had been
                    designated as a traitor.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Its existence intensified the mistrust between the
                    five Union leaders.
                </p>

            </section>


            <!-- THE TRAITOR -->

            <section class="database-section">

                <div class="database-heading">
                    THE TRAITOR
                </div>

                <p>
                    The Master of Masters informed the Foretellers
                    that one among them would betray the others.
                </p>

                <p>
                    No identity was directly revealed to the
                    Foretellers.
                </p>

                <p>
                    The resulting suspicion gradually fractured the
                    relationship between the five Union leaders.
                </p>

            </section>


            <!-- THE DANDELIONS -->

            <section class="database-section">

                <div class="database-heading">
                    THE DANDELIONS
                </div>

                <div class="database-list">

                    <a href="../organizations/dandelions.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        THE DANDELIONS

                    </a>


                    <a href="../people/ephemer.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        EPHEMER

                    </a>


                    <a href="../people/skuld.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        SKULD

                    </a>


                    <a href="../people/brain.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        BRAIN

                    </a>


                    <a href="../people/lauriam.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        LAURIAM

                    </a>


                    <a href="../people/ventus.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        VENTUS

                    </a>

                </div>

                <p>
                    The Dandelions were created as a separate group
                    of Keyblade wielders intended to survive the
                    coming Keyblade War.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Ava was instructed to gather exceptional
                    wielders from the different Unions and remove
                    them from the coming conflict.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Their survival would preserve the light after the
                    destruction of the original world.
                </p>

            </section>


            <!-- AVA'S ASSIGNMENT -->

            <section class="database-section">

                <div class="database-heading">
                    AVA'S ASSIGNMENT
                </div>

                <div class="database-list">

                    <a href="../people/ava.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        AVA

                    </a>

                </div>

                <p>
                    Ava was given a secret mission to gather
                    exceptional Keyblade wielders and form the
                    Dandelions.
                </p>

                <p>
                    She was also given a list of five individuals
                    intended to become the leaders of the Unions
                    following the destruction of the world.
                </p>

                <p>
                    The selected individuals were Ephemer, Skuld,
                    Brain, Lauriam and Strelitzia.
                </p>

            </section>


            <!-- MASTER'S DISAPPEARANCE -->

            <section class="database-section">

                <div class="database-heading">
                    MASTER'S DISAPPEARANCE
                </div>

                <div class="database-list">

                    <a href="../people/master-of-masters.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        MASTER OF MASTERS

                    </a>

                </div>

                <p>
                    The Master of Masters disappeared before the
                    Keyblade War began.
                </p>

                <p>
                    His disappearance left the Foretellers to carry
                    out their assigned roles without direct guidance.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Luxu, however, remained aware of the larger plan
                    and continued observing the events that followed.
                </p>

            </section>


            <!-- GROWING CONFLICT -->

            <section class="database-section">

                <div class="database-heading">
                    GROWING CONFLICT
                </div>

                <p>
                    As the prophecy became increasingly difficult to
                    prevent, the Foretellers began to distrust one
                    another.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Competition over Lux and disagreements regarding
                    the Master's intentions caused the five Unions to
                    move toward open conflict.
                </p>

                <p>
                    The attempt to prevent the foretold war therefore
                    became one of the mechanisms through which the
                    war was brought about.
                </p>

            </section>


            <!-- LUXU AND AVA -->

            <section class="database-section">

                <div class="database-heading">
                    LUXU AND AVA
                </div>

                <div class="database-list">

                    <a href="../people/luxu.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        LUXU

                    </a>


                    <a href="../people/ava.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        AVA

                    </a>

                </div>

                <p>
                    Ava eventually confronted Luxu after discovering
                    information concerning the Master's hidden plan.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Their confrontation became the immediate
                    precursor to the beginning of the Keyblade War.
                </p>

            </section>


            <!-- KEYBLADE WAR -->

            <section class="database-section">

                <div class="database-heading">
                    KEYBLADE WAR
                </div>

                <div class="database-list">

                    <a href="keyblade-war.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        THE KEYBLADE WAR

                    </a>

                </div>

                <p>
                    The events of this chronological period culminate
                    in the beginning of the Keyblade War.
                </p>

                <p>
                    The conflict would destroy the original world and
                    permanently alter the history of the Keyblade.
                </p>

            </section>


            <!-- TRANSITION -->

            <section class="database-section">

                <div class="database-heading">
                    CHRONOLOGICAL TRANSITION
                </div>

                <div class="database-list">

                    <a href="keyblade-war.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        KEYBLADE WAR

                    </a>


                    <a href="after-keyblade-war.html"
                       class="database-link">

                        AFTER THE KEYBLADE WAR

                    </a>

                </div>

                <p>
                    The Keyblade War marks the boundary between the
                    ancient world and the historical period that
                    followed its destruction.
                </p>

                <p>
                    The survivors of the Dandelions would carry the
                    light of the previous world into the future,
                    beginning the next recorded stage of Keyblade
                    history.
                </p>

            </section>


            <!-- CHRONOLOGICAL POSITION -->

            <section class="database-section">

                <div class="database-heading">
                    CHRONOLOGICAL POSITION
                </div>

                <div class="database-status">

                    <div>
